5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good day to you all. Let us embark on this journey with a spirit of cooperation and kindness.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree. Since we have no information yet, we should observe each other's behavior and speech patterns.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,George,,I will be watching from the sidelines. Let's see how this unfolds.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,A logical approach is best. We should look for contradictions as the discussion progresses.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf and save everyone!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, your energy is truly refreshing. It brings a wonderful light to this tense situation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,Does anyone have a specific strategy for the voting process they would like to propose?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,George,,I prefer to make my own judgments based on the evidence provided.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, I think we should wait for the Seer to provide a lead before making any hasty decisions.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm just going to follow my intuition! I'm really good at solving mysteries!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Intuition has its place, but wisdom comes from patience. Let us not rush.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
