31,1,1,talk,Servas,,I hope everyone slept peacefully. Let us begin today's discussion with an open heart.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have information. Servas, I am the Seer, and my divination shows that you are the werewolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"That is a very sudden and direct claim. Are you certain, Minako?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"A Seer revealing themselves on day one is a high-risk strategy, but the information is concrete.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,What?! Servas is the werewolf? But he's so nice and grandpa-like!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Oh, my dear Minako. I am saddened that you would see me in such a light. I assure you, I am human.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,The result of the divination is absolute. I have no reason to lie about this.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,It is possible the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer to eliminate a villager.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, if Minako is the werewolf, she is targeting Servas. If she is the Seer, we found the enemy.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"This is so confusing! Servas, tell us you're not the bad guy!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I can only tell you the truth of my heart, Sakura. I wish only for the village's safety.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,Emotional appeals do not change the facts. The divination was clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,I am still undecided. The composure of both parties is quite similar.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,Logic dictates that we trust the Seer's information. The risk of keeping a known werewolf is too high.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,But it feels so wrong to vote for Servas!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If it is the will of the village to doubt me, I accept it with grace.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,I stand by my result. We must execute Servas to protect the village.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,I suppose the Seer's lead is the only concrete evidence we have. I will follow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I agree. The evidence provided by the Seer is our most reliable tool.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I guess I have to trust Minako, even if I'm sad about it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
